    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: blng__Invoice__c records in Posted status with TotalAmount = 0.
Why it matters: Posted $0 invoices clutter customer histories, may indicate duplicate or erroneous generation, and confuse AR aging reports. Often a sign of a billing-rule bug that didn&apos;t catch zero-line invoices before posting.
Suppress a finding: when $0 invoices are legitimately issued (e.g. credit memo offset).
Disable the detector: only when $0 posted invoices are expected. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
